# misc
.DS_Store
# A plain `.env` is loaded in EVERY vite mode, `test` included - so one sitting
# here would silently give all the unit tests a network-enabled config. Keep
# real values in `.env.production`, which is committed on purpose: the anon key
# it holds ships inside the public bundle anyway. A `service_role` key belongs
# in none of these files.
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*


test.js
deploy_test.sh
node_modules
dist

.nx
